## Assembly documentation

Assemblies are documented with the `cad-doc` skill. The page of an assembly lives at `doc/<assembly>/<assembly>.md`.
Before working on an assembly, read `context/open-questions.md`, `context/notes.md` and `context/assembly-context.md`.
Never save the NX session. Export from NX once into `doc/<assembly>/cad/step/` and work from that archive.
